<view class="page">
  <view class="intro"><text class="eyebrow">SELLER WORKSPACE</text><text class="title">{{info.name}}</text><text>在微信里，用自己的话管理商品和订单。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">查商品、改库存、跟进订单</text><text>问“哪些订单还没发货”，或说“把蓝色杯子的价格改成 25”。助手读取你的店铺资料，生成操作预览，由你确认后执行。支持创建未发布商品草稿。</text><text class="muted">需要连接已认证的卖家账号，仅能访问自己店铺的数据。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Connect your existing shop</text><text>After signing in with WeChat, generate a linking request. Open its website link, sign in to your seller account and confirm the code shown on your phone.</text><text class="muted">No WeChat payment or courier booking is performed by this app. Shipment updates record your own carrier and tracking details.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><button bindtap="privacy">阅读隐私说明</button><checkbox-group bindchange="consentChanged"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{agreed}}"/>我已阅读隐私说明，同意微信登录及说明中的数据处理。</label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="enter" disabled="{{!agreed}}">进入卖家助手</button><text class="muted">启用 AI 时，对话及必要商品、订单摘要会发送给 DeepSeek。客户联系方式和地址不会自动发送，请勿在聊天中输入这些信息。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{info.contact}}" class="card"><text>Operator: {{info.operator}}</text><text>Support and account requests: {{info.contact}}</text><button bindtap="contact">Copy support email</button></view>
</view>
